{"id":"p1m6","name":"Conversion rate per channel","lang":"sql","entry":null,"params":[],"limit_s":10,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p>You have the table <b>visits</b>, with one row per visit of the website:</p>\n<ul><li><code>visit_id</code> - the ID of the visit;</li><li><code>channel</code> - where the visitor came from (<code>\"ads\"</code>, <code>\"seo\"</code>, ...);</li><li><code>purchased</code> - <code>true</code> if the visit ended with a purchase.</li></ul>\n<p>Your task is to return, for each channel, <code>channel</code>, <code>visits</code>, <code>purchases</code> and <code>conversion_pct</code>, the percentage of visits with a purchase rounded to 1 decimal. Sort by <code>channel</code>.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p>Table <code>visits</code>:</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>visit_id</th><th>channel</th><th>purchased</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>ads</td><td>true</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>ads</td><td>false</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>ads</td><td>false</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>seo</td><td>true</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>seo</td><td>true</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>email</td><td>false</td></tr></table></div><p>the output should be</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>channel</th><th>visits</th><th>purchases</th><th>conversion_pct</th></tr><tr><td>ads</td><td>3</td><td>1</td><td>33.3</td></tr><tr><td>email</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td></tr><tr><td>seo</td><td>2</td><td>2</td><td>100.0</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 10 seconds (psql)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 1 GB</div>","starter":"/* Write your PostgreSQL query here */\n","hints":["En PostgreSQL, entier / entier = division entière : 1 / 3 vaut 0. Multiplie d'abord par 100.0.","ROUND(x, 1) marche sur numeric : 100.0 * a / b est numeric, c'est bon. ROUND(double precision, 1) n'existe pas."],"summary_fr":"Par canal : nombre de visites, nombre d'achats, taux = achats / visites en pourcentage arrondi à 1 décimale. Attention à la division entière. Trie par canal.","tags":["division entière","ROUND numeric","COUNT FILTER"],"minutes":5,"source":"Kata Lab","files":null,"visible":[{"input":{"tables":{"visits":{"columns":[["visit_id","INT"],["channel","TEXT"],["purchased","BOOLEAN"]],"rows":[[1,"ads",true],[2,"ads",false],[3,"ads",false],[4,"seo",true],[5,"seo",true],[6,"email",false]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["channel","visits","purchases","conversion_pct"],"rows":[["ads",3,1,33.3],["email",1,0,0.0],["seo",2,2,100.0]]}},{"input":{"tables":{"visits":{"columns":[["visit_id","INT"],["channel","TEXT"],["purchased","BOOLEAN"]],"rows":[[1,"social",false],[2,"social",true],[3,"social",false]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["channel","visits","purchases","conversion_pct"],"rows":[["social",3,1,33.3]]}}],"hidden_n":4,"hidden":"","solution":""}